OL,3,AShip attack reports near Hormuz reach
OL,4,Arecord high as oil exports slow
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of ships that have reported
OL,7,Fbeing attacked in and around the Strait
OL,8,Fof Hormuz has hit a record high, BBC
OL,9,FVerify analysis of data from a UK
OL,10,Fmaritime agency shows.
OL,12,FTwelve vessels were attacked between 5
OL,13,Fand 11 October - the largest number of
OL,14,Fweekly strikes reported to the UK's
OL,15,FMaritime Trade Operations (UKMTO)
OL,16,Fagency since the US-Israeli war with
OL,17,FIran began. The previous week saw 10
OL,18,Fships reporting attacks.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
