OL,3,AChina tells Israel to stop 'forced
OL,4,Aestablishment' of West Bank settlements
OL,5,
OL,6,FChinese foreign minister Wang Yi has
OL,7,Ftold Israel to stop its "forced
OL,8,Festablishment" of settlements in the
OL,9,FWest Bank and reverse its actions, his
OL,10,Foffice said.
OL,12,FThe "Palestinian question" is "the
OL,13,Fgreatest historical injustice of this
OL,14,Fcentury", Wang told Israeli President
OL,15,FIsaac Herzog in a face-to-face meeting
OL,16,Fon the sidelines of a conference in
OL,17,FAzerbaijan on Thursday.
OL,19,FBeijing has been a longstanding
OL,20,Fsupporter of the Palestinian cause and
OL,21,Fhas maintained that a "two-state
OL,22,Fsolution" is the "correct direction".
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/38
